  "predecessor": "EXP-0155/0156 single failed run retained unchanged; no arm validated. This is a distinct six-arm acquisition with the same candidate bytes and corrected host-language handling.",
  "procedure_changes": "Plain CLR object arrays remove reproduced Seek JSON wrappers. Explicit local-field null/int setters replace chained COM assignments; pure mocks did not identify the original COM initiating cause. Validate exact complete baseline metadata, rows, traversal and Seek before probes or next control. Validate each rejected probe before the next mutation. Preserve first error endpoint/stack/inner HRESULT before best-effort rollback/close; copy every retained file independently, record retention failures and always write result. Incomplete/error/cleanup/retention jobs get explicit no_outcome report without promoting a subset."
